---
import '../styles/global.css';
import { projects } from '../data/projects';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Keshav Katwe — Frontend engineer. Product builder.</title>
<meta name="description" content="Keshav Katwe is a frontend engineer and product builder in Dubai. 11+ years shaping React, React Native and thoughtful digital products."/>
<link rel="canonical" href="https://keshavkatwe.github.io/"/><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg"/>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f4f1e9"/><meta property="og:title" content="Keshav Katwe — Interfaces with feeling. Engineering with depth."/><meta property="og:description" content="Selected work: Pushwing, Agenvik, InvestSky and Sense. React · React Native · TypeScript."/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<header class="nav"><a class="wordmark" href="#" aria-label="Keshav Katwe home">keshav<span>✳</span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#work">Work <sup>04</sup></a><a href="#about">A little about me</a><a href="#contact" class="nav-contact">Let’s talk <span>↗</span></a></nav><button id="motion-toggle" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Pause animations" title="Pause animations">Ⅱ</button></header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
<div class="hero-top"><span class="eyebrow"><i></i> Frontend engineer & product builder</span><span class="location">Dubai, UAE <span id="dubai-time"></span></span></div>
<h1 id="hero-title" aria-label="Serious about craft. Playful by nature."><span class="line">Serious about</span><span class="line">craft<span class="punctuation">.</span> <em>Playful</em></span><span class="line last-line"><span>by nature<span class="punctuation">.</span></span><button class="flower" id="flower" aria-label="Change the accent colour"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M50 6C66-8 73 17 68 29C91 18 107 37 84 50C107 63 91 82 68 71C73 94 54 108 50 84C37 107 18 91 29 68C6 73-8 54 16 50C-7 37 9 18 32 29C21 6 40-8 50 6Z" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="11" fill="#24251f"/></svg><span>give me a spin ↗</span></button></span></h1>
<div class="hero-bottom"><p>I’m Keshav. I turn complex problems into<br class="desktop"/> interfaces that feel effortlessly simple.</p><a class="round-link" href="#work"><span class="circle">↓</span><span>Scroll to explore<br/><strong>Selected work, 2023–26</strong></span></a><div class="hero-note">11+ years of building.<br/>Still curious as ever. <span>↙</span></div></div>
<div class="hero-rule"><span>React. React Native. A little obsession.</span><span>Independent mind. Team player.</span></div>
</section>
<section class="work section" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">01 / Selected work</span><h2 id="work-title">Ideas into <em>the real world.</em></h2><p>From the first sketch to the last release.<br/>A few things I’ve put my mind (and heart) into.</p></div>
<div class="projects">{projects.map((project) => <article class={`project ${project.slug}`} style={`--card:${project.color}`} id={project.slug}>
<div class="project-stage" data-tilt>
<div class="stage-top"><span>{project.number} / {project.slug === 'pushwing' || project.slug === 'agenvik' ? 'Built from scratch' : 'Built with a team'}</span><span class="stage-symbol" aria-hidden="true">{project.slug === 'pushwing' ? '↗' : project.slug === 'agenvik' ? '✳' : project.slug === 'investsky' ? '⌁' : '↝'}</span></div>
{project.image ? <div class="browser-frame"><div class="browser-bar"><span>● ● ●</span><span>{project.slug}.com</span><span>↗</span></div><img src={project.image} alt={project.slug === 'pushwing' ? 'Pushwing public website showing its AI-connected publishing workflow' : 'Agenvik published demo dashboard showing knowledge sources and agent configuration'} width={project.slug === 'pushwing' ? 1280 : 1906} height={project.slug === 'pushwing' ? 720 : 1280} loading="lazy"/></div> : project.slug === 'investsky' ? <div class="finance-art" aria-label="Illustrative financial chart interaction"><div class="phone"><div class="phone-notch"></div><span class="tiny">A LITTLE MOMENTUM</span><h3>Good things<br/>are growing<span>↗</span></h3><svg class="chart" viewBox="0 0 320 140" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 120L20 110L40 114L60 88L80 97L100 70L120 78L140 50L160 62L180 39L200 48L220 19L240 30L260 10L280 19L320 0"/></svg><div class="phone-pills"><span>1D</span><span>1W</span><span class="active">1M</span><span>1Y</span></div><div class="phone-bottom">Thoughtful details.<br/><strong>All the way down.</strong></div></div><div class="floating-note">Built for the<br/><em>thumb zone.</em> ✶</div></div> : <div class="sense-art"><span class="tiny">LESS FRICTION. MORE FLOW.</span><div class="deploy-time"><span class="before">20 min</span><span class="arrow">↘</span><strong>&lt; 60<span>sec</span></strong></div><div class="pipeline"><span>Build <i>✓</i></span><span>Check <i>✓</i></span><span>Ship <i>↗</i></span></div><span class="sense-note">Better systems. Happier engineers.</span></div>}
<span class="image-caption">{project.caption}</span></div>
<div class="project-info"><div><span class="eyebrow">{project.type}</span><h3>{project.url ? <a href={project.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{project.name}<span>↗</span></a> : project.name}</h3></div><div class="project-summary"><h4>{project.headline}</h4><p>{project.description}</p><div class="tags">{project.tags.map(tag => <span>{tag}</span>)}</div></div></div>
<details><summary><span>Inside the build</span><span class="details-icon">+</span></summary><div class="case-body">{project.points.map(([title,body])=><div><h4>{title}</h4><p>{body}</p></div>)}{project.url && <a class="text-link" href={project.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{project.link} ↗</a>}{project.slug==='pushwing' && <a class="text-link" href="https://pushwing.com/media/pushwing-how-it-works.mp4" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Watch the product walkthrough ↗</a>}</div></details>
</article>)}</div>
<p class="results-note">Employer results are candidate-reported. Product visuals come from public websites; the mobile illustration is an interaction study.</p></section>
<section class="marquee" aria-label="Thoughtful interfaces. Solid foundations."><div aria-hidden="true">THOUGHTFUL INTERFACES <span>✳</span> SOLID FOUNDATIONS <span>✳</span> THOUGHTFUL INTERFACES <span>✳</span> SOLID FOUNDATIONS <span>✳</span></div></section>
<section class="about section" id="about"><div class="about-label"><span class="eyebrow">02 / The person behind the pixels</span><div class="orb" aria-hidden="true"><span>k</span><span>✳</span></div><p>Engineer by trade.<br/>Builder at heart.</p></div><div class="about-copy"><h2>I like making<br/><em>complicated things</em><br/>feel simple.</h2><p>For 11+ years, I’ve been working where product thinking meets engineering: mobile apps, design systems, frontend architecture, and the tools that help teams do their best work.</p><p>These days, I’m also building Pushwing and Agenvik—taking ideas all the way from “what if?” to working products. I care as much about what happens behind a button as how it feels to press it.</p><div class="skills"><span>React & React Native</span><span>TypeScript</span><span>Design systems</span><span>Frontend architecture</span><span>Agent & MCP integrations</span><span>Technical leadership</span></div><a class="text-link" href="/Keshav-Katwe-Resume.pdf" target="_blank">The longer story, in my résumé ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="contact section" id="contact"><div class="contact-top"><span class="eyebrow"><i></i> Based in Dubai · Available for opportunities</span><span class="eyebrow">03 / Your move</span></div><h2>Got something<br/><em>good in mind?</em></h2><a class="contact-button" href="mailto:keshav.katwe@gmail.com">Let’s build it <span>↗</span></a><div class="contact-bottom"><a href="mailto:keshav.katwe@gmail.com">keshav.katwe@gmail.com</a><button id="copy-email">Copy email <span>⧉</span></button><span id="copy-status" role="status"></span></div></section>
</main>
<footer><a class="wordmark" href="#">keshav<span>✳</span></a><p>Made with intent. And a bit of play.</p><div><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/keshavkatwe/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/keshavkatwe" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a><a href="/Keshav-Katwe-Resume.pdf" target="_blank">Résumé ↗</a></div><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()}</span></footer>
<div class="scroll-progress" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<script>import '../scripts/motion';</script>
</body></html>
